    @ It is not allowed:
    @ 1)Â Â Â Â Â  V1 in MOMMK1
    @ 2)Â Â Â Â Â  Vn/Vn-1 in MOMMKn (n=2~8), whereVn-1 is the via underneath Mn, and Vn is the via above Mn. Vn can be inter-via or TV1 or TV2.
    (V1 AND MOMMK1) NOT INSIDE EXCLU
    (V1 AND MOMMK2) NOT INSIDE EXCLU
    (V2 AND MOMMK2) NOT INSIDE EXCLU
    (V2 AND MOMMK3) NOT INSIDE EXCLU
