DFM_R_13_M1 {
    @ Mn (n=1~8)/TM1 jog/notch size>=min width of the layer, when Mn jog/notch width<0.15um or TM1 jog/notch width<0.45um (See attached picture)
    X = CONVEX EDGE M1 ANGLE1 == 90 ANGLE2 == 270
    Y = INT X > 0.085 < 0.15 OPPOSITE REGION PARA ONLY
    Z = LENGTH Y < 0.09
    A = Y WITH EDGE Z
    B = CONVEX EDGE M1 ANGLE1 == 90 ANGLE2 == 90
    (A NOT WITH EDGE B) NOT INSIDE EXDFM
}
